    "chunk_text": "& ergende w\u00e6ron & hiera tilgende. Her cuom se here into Escanceastre from Werham, & se sciphere sigelede west ymbutan, & \u00fea mette & se cyning \u00e6lfred \u00e6fter \u00feam gehorsudan here mid fierde rad o\u00fe Exanceaster & hie hindan ofridan & \u00fea on h\u00e6rf\u00e6ste gefor se here on Miercna lond, & hit ged\u00e6ldon sum, & sum Ceolwulfe saldon. Her hiene best\u00e6l se here on midne winter ofer tuelftan niht to Cippanhamme, & geridon Wesseaxna & \u00fe\u00e6s ilcan wintra w\u00e6s Inw\u00e6res bro\u00feur & Healfdenes on West Seaxum on Defenascire mid xxiii & \u00fe\u00e6s on Eastron worhte \u00e6lfred cyning lytle werede geweorc \u00e6t \u00e6\u00feelinga eigge, & of \u00feam \u00dea on \u00fe\u00e6re seofo\u00f0an wiecan ofer Eastron he gerad to Ecgbryhtes stane be eastan Sealwyda, & him & he for ymb ane niht of \u00feam wicum to Iglea, & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb ane to E\u00feandune, & \u00fe\u00e6r gefeaht wi\u00fe & \u00fea salde se here him foregislas & micle a\u00feas, \u00fe\u00e6t hie of his rice uuoldon, & him eac geheton \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb iii wiecan com se cyning to him Godrum \u00feritiga sum \u00feara monna \u00fee in \u00feam here & his se cyning \u00fe\u00e6r onfeng \u00e6t fulwihte, & his crismlising was \u00e6t We\u00femor, & he was xii niht mid Her for se here to Cirenceastre of Cippan hamme.",
